[b]Quartermaster — Storage & Base Management[/b]

Twelve chests of “miscellaneous”? The owl would like a word.

[b]Storage & Inventory[/b]
[list]
[*]Deposit supplies into a Deposit Chest and automatically sort them into matching storage.
[*]Chests remember assigned item types even when empty. Configure preferred destinations, overflow storage, base groups and supply permissions.
[*]Deposit All, sort chests and inventories, combine compatible stacks, and choose which item types to ignore during automatic pickup.
[/list]

[b]Ledger Lectern[/b]
[list]
[*]Build the lectern from the Hammer’s Quartermaster category and interact with its book.
[*]View loaded base inventory and queued production, search items, and edit shared production limits.
[*]Switch between normal stack sizes and a custom maximum directly in game. On servers, stack changes require host or admin access and apply to everyone.
[*]When a chest stack exceeds its limit, the excess pops out in correctly sized stacks for the player or owl to collect. Busy or blocked chests wait.
[/list]

[b]Crafting & Base Automation[/b]
[list]
[*]Craft, build and upgrade using eligible nearby storage, with extended building-station coverage around Deposit Chests.
[*]Supply compatible processors, fermenters and cooking racks, then collect finished goods.
[*]Set production limits, pause machines, protect valuable wood, supply fuel and feed animals. Feeding creatures being tamed is optional.
[*]With Helmsman installed, ask the gull captain to unload ship cargo into your base.
[/list]

[b]Your Owl Assistant[/b]
[list]
[*]An updated, hat-free owl with flatter facial feathers, head bobs, preening, stretches and quiet calls.
[*]Rests on the Deposit Chest and visits active workstations, tossing matching item props to show activity. Automation runs independently of his animations.
[*]Uses obstacle-aware flight, hops and recovery when a route is blocked.
[*]After resting, collects up to three nearby dropped items per trip, respecting chest capacity, access and pickup exclusions.
[*]Occasionally visits the ledger, looks over its pages and turns a leaf before returning to his tasks.
[/list]

[b]Setup & Controls[/b]
Requires BepInEx and Jötunn. Disable overlapping storage and automation mods. Mark a chest as a Deposit Chest, place example items in receiving storage, and configure supply permissions. Press F9 while aiming at a machine for its settings. Menus support controller navigation.

Normal recipe and station requirements still apply. Automation works in loaded areas and does not automatically restock your player inventory. Production limits stop new production; they do not delete stored items.

[b]Testing:[/b] The new owl, ledger and overflow features await in-game verification. Multiplayer remains untested; use matching versions on server and clients.

